        "original_id": "6a4180d9-3644-588d-81a8-2e69972d5829",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jürgen M. Geissinger\n- Companies: Senvion S.A., Schaeffler AG, Continental AG\n- Places: Hamburg\n- Roles: Chief Executive Officer\n- Products: Wind turbines, tyres\n\nFacts:\n- Jürgen M. Geissinger was born on July 24, 1959.\n- Jürgen M. Geissinger is a German technology business executive.\n- Jürgen M. Geissinger is the Chief Executive Officer of Senvion S.A.\n- Senvion S.A. is a Hamburg-based wind turbine manufacturer.\n- Schaeffler AG employs over 76,000 people across 180 locations in 50 countries.\n- Schaeffler AG has annual sales of $14 billion.\n- Schaeffler AG is the controlling shareholder of Continental AG with 49.9% of its shares.\n- Continental AG is the world's fourth-largest tyre manufacturer.",
